        {
          "page": 2,
          "section": "Abstract",
          "quote": "The present work contributes to a better understanding of the basic assumptions and principles behind the design of Ni-based single crystal superalloys (SXs).",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "a6ab38c086303720:part:001"
        },
        {
          "page": "22",
          "section": "5. Summary and Conclusions",
          "quote": "In the present work, we compare the local alloy chemistry, the microstructures and the creep properties of four Ni-base single crystal superalloys, a CMSX-4 variant with Re (referred to as ERBO/1) and three Re-free alloys referred to as ERBO/15, ERBO/15-Mo (less Mo than in ERBO/15) and ERBO/15-W (less W than in ERBO/15).",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "a6ab38c086303720:part:002"
        },
        {
          "page": "29",
          "section": "Highlights",
          "quote": "A computer aided newly developed Ni-based superalloy ERBO/15 without Re outperforms the creep performance of ERBO/1 (CMSX-4 type) with Re.",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "a6ab38c086303720:part:003"
        }
      ]
    }
